		{"id":"p7","type":"text","text":"◇\n**preempt**\n资源不足取舍","x":500,"y":855,"width":190,"height":120,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"h","type":"text","text":"## Resource Pressure\n- KV block 不足\n- prefill 太长\n- active seq 太多\n- tail latency 上升","x":80,"y":760,"width":390,"height":300,"color":"6"}
